  "description": "Builds on types of the ConstTypeArgs.Core library to provide const type arguments that allow you to use generic parameters to \"pass\" delegates to generics. This provides an analog to type specialization in C++, and can be used for scenarios such as:\n* Static polymorphism,\n* Eliminating unnecessary instance constructors,\n* \"Passing\" values to type initializers,\n* And a more.",
